{"ticker":"AXP","updated":"2026-11-20T22:39:53Z","profile":{"longName":"American Express Company","shortName":"American Express Company","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.americanexpress.com","fullTimeEmployees":76800,"marketCap":202305552384,"trailingPE":16.997183,"forwardPE":14.923447,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.776939,"pegRatio":1.29,"targetMeanPrice":364.78708,"targetHighPrice":425.0,"targetLowPrice":329.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":24,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.113,"earningsGrowth":0.309,"grossMargins":0.61954,"operatingMargins":0.19356,"profitMargins":0.16823,"totalRevenue":72851996672,"beta":1.077,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":387.49,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":290.97,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.22},"summary":"American Express Company, together with its subsidiaries, operates as an integrated payments company in the United States, Europe, the Middle East and Africa, the Asia Pacific, Australia, New Zealand, Latin America, Canada, the Caribbean, and internationally. It operates through four segments: U.S. Consumer Services, Commercial Services, International Card Services, and Global Merchant and Network Services. The company offers credit and charge cards and complementary products and services, including travel, dining, and lifestyle and expense management products and services; and banking and other payment and financing products and services, including deposits and non-card lending. It also provides merchant acquisition and processing, servicing and settlement, fraud prevention, and point-of-sale marketing and information products and services, as well as network services. The company offers its products and services to consumers, small businesses, mid-sized companies, and large corporations through mobile and online applications, affiliate marketing, customer referral programs, third-party service providers and business partners, in-house sales teams, direct mail, telephone, and direct response advertising. American Express Company was founded in 1850 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","summary_zh":"美國運通公司及其子公司作為一家綜合支付公司在美國、歐洲、中東和非洲、亞太地區、澳洲、紐西蘭、拉丁美洲、加拿大、加勒比海地區和國際上運作。它透過四個部門運作：美國消費者服務部、商業服務部、國際卡服務部以及全球商家和網路服務部。該公司提供信用卡和簽帳卡以及配套產品和服務，包括旅遊、餐飲、生活方式和費用管理產品和服務；銀行及其他支付和融資產品和服務，包括存款和非卡貸款。它還提供商戶收購和處理、服務和結算、詐欺預防、銷售點行銷和資訊產品和服務以及網路服務。該公司透過行動和線上應用程式、聯盟行銷、客戶推薦計畫、第三方服務提供者和業務合作夥伴、內部銷售團隊、直郵、電話和直接回應廣告，向消費者、小型企業、中型企業和大型企業提供產品和服務。美國運通公司成立於1850年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"信用服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":339.51,"h":345.51,"l":338.38,"c":340.98,"v":3328000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":341.94,"h":349.19,"l":340.01,"c":341.47,"v":2697600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":342.97,"h":345.0,"l":338.51,"c":340.48,"v":2279100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":336.91,"h":340.77,"l":334.0,"c":340.18,"v":2223900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":341.45,"h":343.33,"l":339.02,"c":341.68,"v":1728600},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":343.76,"h":344.85,"l":338.5,"c":342.31,"v":1658100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":341.6,"h":342.96,"l":328.15,"c":332.16,"v":3327300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":331.0,"h":335.77,"l":328.4,"c":328.56,"v":2598800},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":328.45,"h":331.98,"l":326.28,"c":330.48,"v":1907600},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":332.0,"h":332.04,"l":328.72,"c":330.24,"v":2404000},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":332.0,"h":334.0,"l":326.25,"c":331.99,"v":2116200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":332.65,"h":334.94,"l":325.74,"c":327.97,"v":1708900},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":328.67,"h":329.15,"l":323.58,"c":323.82,"v":2184300},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":326.48,"h":328.31,"l":324.05,"c":324.44,"v":2094800},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":325.2,"h":328.1,"l":315.95,"c":316.26,"v":2684700},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":319.17,"h":324.36,"l":319.06,"c":323.12,"v":1693100},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":321.61,"h":336.33,"l":320.5,"c":332.85,"v":2810400},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":333.86,"h":336.92,"l":330.28,"c":330.66,"v":2186000},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":331.02,"h":332.5,"l":320.0,"c":323.12,"v":3268000},{"t":"2025-10-17","