V2JOemtpNzV6NmZiNmxJMTlHRG52OUtQUnpoUnlyZUN4a2tPbF84cmVMSzk5djhqMnVZLVJiUVotV24wMFhhbDFKdUxKR2E?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"AXP（NYSE：AXP）卡費用成長與保費支出提升美國運通前景"},{"title":"Salesforce Partners With Mitti Labs in Deal Projected to Save 700 Billion Liters of Water","src":"https://www.thekeyexecutives.com/","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-19","zh":"Salesforce 與 Mitti Labs 合作預計可節省 7,000 億公升水"},{"title":"Check your offer: Save up to 50% on Amazon purchases using just 429 Amex points","src":"The Points Guy","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTFBpTmdXMFdDZWU3dUZVaHBHQ1BFZ2RWTi1Tb2kyckRGaG5CMHc5c1dIdmptQndlaHNQbDR4eUhNODRLQWh3NG5vM1EyRWhLNU5jZ1QwYzFLMGVrcnZlWEs4ak1qTnVUUGo4QmpTelFCNlpnT21wX203TA?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"檢查您的優惠：僅使用 429 Amex 積分在亞馬遜購物即可節省高達 50%"},{"title":"American Express Gold Card current welcome offer","src":"The Points Guy","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTFBabmVudEtrX2FpaG1YcHdEdEREeDFIQ2VVNHR5Ulc2Qi1rZHlaRDNGb25od2w3T3Jrcl8zaTYwc1FvZ0RzVTlaTF9ZZ1BTdXl6WHRUb1hGc1dENFFkMkVGN0RpcUpteE1EdEtIMXZ3?oc=5","date":"2026-11-18","zh":"美國運通金卡目前迎新優惠"},{"title":"The best time to apply for Amex cards based on offer history","src":"The Points Guy","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE1EaGhvYzlBLUt3UzgtMVVrSWZVZ005QlJXYzhYb2tpSTg0aEw1UlJhMDRvNEVsd1otaHItRmNjeE00X1ZKaFFLLVNVMjNwbHFnMFBCaUJ4NFpxV25IZkRORTExeFptSmk5ek4zZzJ2THVJZ2hOYnBnME5oV2lvVGc?oc=5","date":"2026-11-17","zh":"根據優惠歷史申請美國運通卡的最佳時間"}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-06","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/4962/000000496226000080/axp-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"American Express is a global payments and premium lifestyle brand powered by technology. Founded in 1850 and headquartered in New York, American Express' card-issuing, merchant-acquiring and card network businesses offer products and services to a broad range of customers, including consumers, small businesses, mid-sized companies and large corporations around the world.","zh":"美國運通是一個以科技為動力的全球支付和優質生活風格品牌。美國運通成立於 1850 年，總部位於紐約，其發卡、商家收單和卡片網路業務為廣泛的客戶提供產品和服務，包括世界各地的消費者、小型企業、中型企業和大型企業。"},{"en":"These products and services are offered through various channels, including mobile and online applications, affiliate marketing, customer referral programs, third-party service providers and business partners, in-house sales teams, direct mail, telephone and direct response advertising.","zh":"這些產品和服務透過各種管道提供，包括行動和線上應用程式、聯盟行銷、客戶推薦計畫、第三方服務提供者和業務合作夥伴、內部銷售團隊、直郵、電話和直接回應廣告。"},{"en":"We were founded as a joint stock association and incorporated in 1965 as a New York corporation. American Express Company and its principal operating subsidiary, American Express Travel Related Services Company, Inc. (TRS), are bank holding companies under the Bank Holding Company Act of 1956, as amended (the BHC Act), subject to supervision and examination by The Board of Governors of the Federal Reserve System (the Federal Reserve).","zh":"我們以股份製形式成立，並於 1965 年作為一家紐約公司註冊成立。美國運通公司及其主要營運子公司美國運通旅行相關服務公司 (TRS) 是根據 1956 年《銀行控股公司法》及其修訂版（BHC 法）規定的銀行控股公司，接受美國聯邦儲備系統（簡稱「聯準會」）理事會的監督和審查。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Delta is our largest strategic partner. Our relationships with, and revenues and expenses related to, Delta are significant and represent an important source of value for our Card Members. We issue cards under cobrand arrangements with Delta and the Delta cobrand portfolio continued to represent approximately 13 percent of worldwide billed business and approximately 21 percent of worldwide Card Member loans as of December 31, 2025. The Delta cobrand portfolio generates fee revenue and interest income from Card Members and discount revenue from Delta and other merchants for spending on Delta cobrand cards. The current Delta cobrand agreement runs through the end of 2029 and we expect to continue to make significant investments in this partnership. Among other things, Delta is also a key participant in our Membership Rewards program, provides travel-related benefits and services, including","zh":"達美航空是我們最大的戰略合作夥伴。我們與達美的關係以及與之相關的收入和支出非常重要，是我們持卡會員的重要價值來源。我們根據與達美的聯合品牌安排發行卡，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，達美聯品牌組合繼續佔全球計費業務的約 13%，佔全球卡會員貸款的約 21%。達美聯品牌組合產生來自卡片會員的費用收入和利息收入，以及來自達美和其他商家使用達美聯品牌卡消費的折扣收入。目前的達美聯品牌協議有效期至 2029 年底，我們預計將繼續對此合作關係進行重大投資。除此之外，達美也是我們會員獎勵計畫的主要參與者，提供與旅行相關的福利和服務，包括"}],"competition":[{"en":"We compete in the global payments industry with networks, issuers, acquirers and other payment service providers and methods of payment, including paper-based transactions (e.g., cash and checks) and electronic transfers (e.g., wire transfers and Automated Clearing House (ACH)), as well as evolving and growing alternative mechanisms, systems and products that leverage new technologies, business models and customer relationships to create payment, financing or banking solutions. The payments industry continues to undergo changes in response to evolving technologies, business dynamics and competition for premium customers.","zh":"我們在全球支付產業中與網路、發行機構、收單機構和其他支付服務提供者以及支付方式競爭，包括紙本交易（例如現金和支票）和電子轉帳（例如電彙和自動清算所 (ACH)），以及不斷發展和成長的替代機制、系統和產品，這些機制、系統和產品利用新技術、業務模式和客戶關係來創建支付、融資或解決方案。為了因應不斷發展的技術、業務動態和優質客戶的競爭，支付產業不斷變化。"},{"en":"As a card issuer, we compete with financial institutions that issue general-purpose credit and debit cards, as well as businesses that issue private label cards, operate mobile wallets, provide payment services or extend credit. We face intense competition in the premium space and for cobrand relationships, as both card issuer and network competitors have targeted high-spending customers and key business partners with attractive value propositions. For example, there is heightened competition with respect to several aspects of our Card Member value propositions, such as in partnerships and other differentiated offerings (e.g., lounge space in U.S. and global hub airports, dining experiences and other experiential offerings). Our banking products also face strong competition, such as with respect to the rates offered on deposits.","zh":"作為發卡機構，我們與發行通用信用卡和金融卡的金融機構以及發行自有品牌卡、經營行動錢包、提供支付服務或提供信貸的企業競爭。我們在高端領域和聯名品牌關係方面面臨著激烈的競爭，因為發卡機構和網路競爭對手都以具有吸引力的價值主張瞄準高消費客戶和主要業務合作夥伴。例如，我們的卡會員價值主張的多個方面的競爭加劇，例如合作夥伴關係和其他差異化服務（例如美國和全球樞紐機場的休息室空間、餐飲體驗和其他體驗式服務）。我們的銀行產品也面臨激烈的競爭，例如存款利率方面。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US Consumer Services","val":15626000000,"zh":"美國消費者服務部門"},{"name":"Commercial Services","val":11856000000,"zh":"商業服務部門"},{"name":"International Card Services","val":7544000000,"zh":"國際卡服務部門"},{"name":"Global Merchant & Network Services","val":6306000000,"zh":"全球商家和網路服務部門"}],"total":41304000000}},"peers":["V","MA","GS","WFC","CAT"]}}